            "rationale": "Most new rules are in Tier 2: Catalog.search does case-insensitive title/author matching in book id order, Catalog.isOnShelf defines on-shelf, and Catalog.branches gives branch order. Search and branch counts in Tier 3 call Catalog.isOnShelf. Views.bookCopies does not call it. It works out on-loan vs on-shelf itself by looking the copy up in library.Loans, so Tier 3 repeats part of the on-shelf rule. The two agree, so nothing contradicts.",
